{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2019b.q32.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面的文字，按要求作文。 某一布鞋品牌的老板经营模式很简单，每卖出一双鞋子，就捐赠一双给贫困地区的孩子，让没有鞋穿的孩子拥有一双自己的鞋，可是生意却不见起色。半年后，一家报社报道了他“卖一双，捐一双”的故事，立刻引起了轰动。人们为他的事迹所感动。短短一天之内，他接到2200多双鞋子的订单。到目前为止，已经卖出了3800万双，这意味着非洲，拉丁美洲，亚洲等贫困地区的3800多万小脚丫有了鞋子的保护。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2019年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "59f6a69326dfc94dc476ea421f9790e8e9d09c83b7b1875ea6088b364ebb9a13", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4935, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5137, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2019年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "59f6a69326dfc94dc476ea421f9790e8e9d09c83b7b1875ea6088b364ebb9a13"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2019b.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2019b.q32"], "word_count": 202, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2019年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2019年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "59f6a69326dfc94dc476ea421f9790e8e9d09c83b7b1875ea6088b364ebb9a13", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4935, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5137, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2019年下半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "59f6a69326dfc94dc476ea421f9790e8e9d09c83b7b1875ea6088b364ebb9a13"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authoriz